## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- EMA(9): `iMA(NULL, PERIOD_H1, 9, 0, MODE_EMA, PRICE_CLOSE, i)`
- EMA(30): `iMA(NULL, PERIOD_H1, 30, 0, MODE_EMA, PRICE_CLOSE, i)`
- Momentum: `iMomentum(NULL, PERIOD_H1, 14, PRICE_CLOSE, i)` — MT5 returns ratio × 100 (default); level 100 = zero-change baseline
- TD High Point scan: for each bar[i] check `High[i+1] < High[i] && High[i-1] < High[i]`; collect last 3+ such bars with monotonically decreasing High
- TD trendline through 3 TD High Points: compute slope from first to last TD High Point; project line; break condition: `Close[0] > projected_line_value`
- For P1 (MVP): simplify to pivot-based trend line using ZigZag(13,5,3) turning points rather than strict TD Points — note this simplification in LESSONS LEARNED when built
- SL: 40 pips fixed; trailing: update SL every 10 pips in profit direction
- P3 sweeps: EMA periods (7/9/12 vs 25/30/34), Momentum period (10/14/21), TP cap (40/100/150 pips), trail step (5/10/20 pips)

